DESCRIPTION:Keen to learn bootscooting in an upbeat and entertaining enviro
 nment? Come along to Footloose Fun line dancing classes\, held every Monda
 y night at Northgate Hall. Sessions: 6.30-7.40pm - beginner level 7.45-8.5
 0pm - improver/intermediate level. $15pp for the night\, regardless of if 
 you are there for one lesson or both. Kids can come along for free\, provi
 ded they are accompanied by a paying adult. Wear closed-in shoes which won
 't stick to the floor\, and clothes you are comfy moving around in (denim\
 , activewear\, whatever suits). No need to book in\, just turn up! Bring y
 our friends\, or come along on your own. No prior knowledge is needed. For
  more information\, visit the Footloose Fun website or contact Claire Harr
 is on 0400 291 447 or via email .
